1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? – Xorijlik talabaning bir kuni.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
1-qism: Vatan va yangi hayot / Vatan xotiralari va yangi boshlanishlar

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:16,808
Mening vatanimda qor yogʻmaydi.

4
00:00:16,830 --> 00:00:21,864
Har doim koʻk dengiz koʻrinib turadi.

5
00:00:21,887 --> 00:00:27,387
Men shu iliq shaharda voyaga yetdim.

6
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:31,797
Men kameralarni yaxshi koʻraman.

7
00:00:31,821 --> 00:00:36,581
Hali koʻrmagan manzaralarni koʻrishni xohlayman.

8
00:00:36,604 --> 00:00:41,512
Shuning uchun Yaponiyaning universitetiga keldim.

9
00:00:41,535 --> 00:00:47,369
Mening ismim bir oz uzun.

10
00:00:47,392 --> 00:00:54,225
Lekin Yapon doʻstlarim menga qisqa laqab bilan murojat qilishadi.

11
00:00:54,248 --> 00:00:58,948
Men koʻp kuladigan insonman.

12
00:00:58,971 --> 00:01:04,205
Yangi va qiziqarli narsalarni juda yaxshi koʻraman.

13
00:01:04,228 --> 00:01:09,461
Yaponiya hayotim har kuni porlab turadi.

14
00:01:09,484 --> 00:01:13,519
A, xayrli tong!

15
00:01:13,543 --> 00:01:17,843
A, Sakura-san. Xayrli tong!

16
00:01:17,866 --> 00:01:21,141
Bugun ham erta turding-ku.

17
00:01:21,164 --> 00:01:25,998
Ha. Ertalabki havoni yaxshi koʻraman.

18
00:01:26,021 --> 00:01:29,961
Bugungi kamerang ham zoʻr koʻrinibdi.

19
00:01:29,985 --> 00:01:35,418
Ha. Bu mening eng qimmatbaho buyumim.

20
00:01:35,441 --> 00:01:39,479
Ertalab nima suratga olayotgansan?

21
00:01:39,502 --> 00:01:44,661
Yoʻl chetida kichik gul ochib qolgan edi.

22
00:01:44,685 --> 00:01:48,785
Bu olcha guli emas-ku.

23
00:01:48,808 --> 00:01:53,241
Ha. Oq va kichik gul edi.

24
00:01:53,264 --> 00:01:56,531
Juda ham chiroyli edi.

25
00:01:56,554 --> 00:01:59,352
Shundaymi?

26
00:01:59,376 --> 00:02:02,242
Yaxshi suratga tushdi?

27
00:02:02,265 --> 00:02:06,500
Ha. Keyinroq koʻrsataman.

28
00:02:06,524 --> 00:02:09,957
Kutib turaman.

29
00:02:09,980 --> 00:02:13,364
Yapon hayotiga allaqachon koʻnikdingmi?

30
00:02:13,388 --> 00:02:17,769
Ha, biroz koʻnikdim.

31
00:02:17,793 --> 00:02:21,228
Yapon taomlari qanday?

32
00:02:21,251 --> 00:02:25,084
Juda ham mazali.

33
00:02:25,107 --> 00:02:29,007
Ayniqsa ramenni yaxshi koʻraman.

34
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:32,025
Ramen haqiqatan ham mazali, shunday emasmi?

35
00:02:32,049 --> 00:02:35,392
Qaysi doʻkonga bording?

36
00:02:35,416 --> 00:02:40,249
Stansiya oldidagi qizil reklama taxtali doʻkon.

37
00:02:40,272 --> 00:02:44,039
A, u yer-ku.

38
00:02:44,062 --> 00:02:46,861
U yer mashhur ekan.

39
00:02:46,884 --> 00:02:51,617
Ha, har doim odamlar navbatda turadi.

40
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:54,987
Boshqa qiyinchiliklar yoʻqmi?

41
00:02:55,011 --> 00:03:01,244
Hmm, kanji oʻrganish bir oz qiyin.

42
00:03:01,267 --> 00:03:04,236
Kanji qiyin, shundaymi?

43
00:03:04,259 --> 00:03:08,093
Yaponlar uchun ham qiyin.

44
00:03:08,116 --> 00:03:10,273
Rostdanmi?

45
00:03:10,297 --> 00:03:13,663
Biroz yengilroq his qildim.

46
00:03:13,686 --> 00:03:19,153
Nimadir tushunmagan boʻlsa, istalgan vaqtda soʻrashing mumkin.

47
00:03:19,176 --> 00:03:21,363
Rahmat.

48
00:03:21,386 --> 00:03:24,653
Juda ham xursand boʻldim.

49
00:03:24,676 --> 00:03:27,833
Lugʻatdan foydalanayapsanmi?

50
00:03:27,856 --> 00:03:32,690
Ha, smartfondagi lugʻatdan foydalanaman.

51
00:03:32,713 --> 00:03:36,016
Juda qulay, shunday emasmi?

52
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:42,239
Ha, lekin o‘zim yozish qiyin.

53
00:03:42,262 --> 00:03:46,296
Har kuni oz-ozdan yozaversang, muammo bo‘lmaydi.

54
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:49,630
Ha, harakat qilaman.

55
00:03:49,654 --> 00:03:53,355
Bugungi birinchi dars qaysi?

56
00:03:53,378 --> 00:03:56,717
Yapon tarixi.

57
00:03:56,740 --> 00:04:00,640
A, men bilan bir xil ekan.

58
00:04:00,664 --> 00:04:03,018
Birga boramiz.

59
00:04:03,041 --> 00:04:06,308
Ha, boramiz.

60
00:04:06,331 --> 00:04:10,464
O‘qituvchi gapirganda tezligini tushunasizmi?

61
00:04:10,487 --> 00:04:14,228
Ba’zida tushunmay qolaman.

62
00:04:14,251 --> 00:04:17,718
Daftarimni beraman, aytib tur.

63
00:04:17,741 --> 00:04:22,008
Sakura-san har doim mehribon.

64
00:04:22,031 --> 00:04:27,387
U bilan gaplashganda yuragim iliq bo‘ladi.

65
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:33,344
Yapon universitetidagi hayot juda qiziqarli.

66
00:04:33,367 --> 00:04:42,376
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsif va eng yaxshi kommentdan yuklab olish mumkin. Yuklashdan oldin iltimos, komment qoldiring.

67
00:04:42,376 --> 00:04:43,876
Sahna 2: Kutubxona va tarix / Kutubxonalar va tarix

68
00:04:43,876 --> 00:04:47,451
Dars tugadi.

69
00:04:47,474 --> 00:04:51,974
Universitet kutubxonasi juda katta.

70
00:04:51,997 --> 00:04:57,230
Mening mamlakatimdagi kutubxonaga qaraganda ko‘proq kitob bor.

71
00:04:57,254 --> 00:05:01,155
Eski qog‘ozlarning hidi keladi.

72
00:05:01,178 --> 00:05:06,169
Men bu sokin joylarni yaxshi ko‘raman.

73
00:05:06,193 --> 00:05:09,693
Men tarixni yaxshi ko‘raman.

74
00:05:09,716 --> 00:05:16,849
Qadim zamonlardagi odamlar ham biz kabi kulganlar, yig‘laganlar.

75
00:05:16,873 --> 00:05:21,668
Buni o‘ylaganimda g‘alati his qilaman.

76
00:05:21,692 --> 00:05:24,825
Charchadingizmi?

77
00:05:24,848 --> 00:05:29,205
A, Sakura-san. Charchadingizmi?

78
00:05:29,229 --> 00:05:33,411
Yapon tarixi darsi qanday edi?

79
00:05:33,434 --> 00:05:36,734
Juda qiziqarli edi.

80
00:05:36,757 --> 00:05:39,303
Rostdanmi?

81
00:05:39,327 --> 00:05:42,110
Qiyin emas edimi?

82
00:05:42,133 --> 00:05:45,927
Biroz qiyin edi.

83
00:05:45,951 --> 00:05:50,148
Lekin o‘qituvchi gaplari qiziqarli.

84
00:05:50,171 --> 00:05:54,938
Qadimiy yapon binolariga qiziqasanmi?

85
00:05:54,962 --> 00:05:59,729
Ha. Ibodatxonalar va ziyoratgohlarning rasmlari yoqadi.

86
00:05:59,752 --> 00:06:03,985
Keyinroq Kyoto shahriga borib ko‘rsang yaxshi bo‘ladi.

87
00:06:04,008 --> 00:06:06,792
Kyoto shahri?

88
00:06:06,816 --> 00:06:09,386
Uzoqmi?

89
00:06:09,410 --> 00:06:13,795
Shinkansen (tez poyezd) bilan biroz vaqt ketadi.

90
00:06:13,819 --> 00:06:19,085
Shundaymi? Bir kun albatta borishni xohlayman.

91
00:06:19,108 --> 00:06:22,742
U yerda ko‘p qadimiy binolar bor.

92
00:06:22,765 --> 00:06:26,317
Ko‘p rasmga olishni xohlayman.

93
00:06:26,340 --> 00:06:29,640
Ibodatxonalarning bog‘lari ham go‘zal.

94
00:06:29,663 --> 00:06:34,644
Yapon bog‘lari daraxtlari va toshlari bilan chiroyli.

95
00:06:34,668 --> 00:06:39,801
Ha, fasllarga qarab manzara o‘zgarib turadi.

96
00:06:39,824 --> 00:06:42,539
Bu juda ajoyib.

97
00:06:42,563 --> 00:06:47,030
Keyingi darsgacha hali vaqt bor-ku.

98
00:06:47,053 --> 00:06:51,286
Ha. Kitob o‘qib o‘tiraman.

99
00:06:51,309 --> 00:06:54,176
Qanday kitob o‘qiysan?

100
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:57,268
Yapon mangasi.

101
00:06:57,291 --> 00:07:00,444
Kanji mashq qilish imkoniyati bo‘ladi.

102
00:07:00,467 --> 00:07:04,567
Nima? Manga orqali o‘qiysanmi?

103
00:07:04,590 --> 00:07:08,747
Ha, so‘zlar tabiiy bo‘ladi, yaxshi.

104
00:07:08,771 --> 00:07:12,346
Shundaymi? Ajoyibsiz!

105
00:07:12,370 --> 00:07:16,703
Yo‘q, manga yoqtirib o‘qiyman shunchaki.

106
00:07:16,726 --> 00:07:19,859
Tavsiya qiladigan manga bormi?

107
00:07:19,882 --> 00:07:24,027
Bu sport mangasi juda qiziqarli.

108
00:07:24,050 --> 00:07:27,398
Men ham o‘qib ko‘rayinmi?

109
00:07:27,422 --> 00:07:31,555
Albatta o‘qing. Qarzga beraman.

110
00:07:31,578 --> 00:07:34,330
Qarzga olsam bo‘ladimi?

111
00:07:34,354 --> 00:07:36,496
Rahmat.

112
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:42,352
Men yoqtirgan narsalarimni do‘stlarim bilan baham ko‘rishni yaxshi ko‘raman.

113
00:07:42,375 --> 00:07:46,875
Yapon mangalari haqida ko‘proq gaplashmoqchiman.

114
00:07:46,898 --> 00:07:54,003
Bugungi videodagi darslarni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan o‘chirilishi mumkin.

115
00:07:54,003 --> 00:07:55,503
3-Sahna: Universitet oshxonasining zavqlari

116
00:07:55,503 --> 00:07:58,936
Tushlik tanaffusi.

117
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:03,899
Oshxonadan mazali hid kelmoqda.

118
00:08:03,923 --> 00:08:07,023
Qorni ochib qoldi.

119
00:08:07,046 --> 00:08:12,683
Mening mamlakatimda bunday katta oshxona yo‘q.

120
00:08:12,707 --> 00:08:17,065
Hammamiz birga tushlik qutilarimizni yeymiz.

121
00:08:17,089 --> 00:08:22,555
Yapon universitetlarining oshxonasida juda ko‘p menyu bor.

122
00:08:22,578 --> 00:08:27,212
Har kuni turli taomlarni tatib ko‘raman.

123
00:08:27,235 --> 00:08:32,225
Bu mening zavqlarimdan biri.

124
00:08:32,248 --> 00:08:36,764
Bo‘sh joy topib qo‘ygandik, yaxshi bo‘ldi.

125
00:08:36,787 --> 00:08:40,968
Ha, juda gavjum ekan.

126
00:08:40,992 --> 00:08:44,259
Bugun nima yeysan?

127
00:08:44,282 --> 00:08:48,670
Men karri-guruch tanladim.

128
00:08:48,693 --> 00:08:52,593
Karri-guruch yoqtirasanmi?

129
00:08:52,616 --> 00:08:56,950
Ha, juda yoqadi.

130
00:08:56,972 --> 00:09:00,641
Mening mamlakatimda ham karri bor.

131
00:09:00,664 --> 00:09:04,931
Lekin, ta’mi biroz farq qiladi.

132
00:09:04,954 --> 00:09:08,721
Yapon karri shirinmi?

133
00:09:08,744 --> 00:09:14,293
Ha, shirin va quyuqroq.

134
00:09:14,316 --> 00:09:18,227
Men bugun udon tanladim.

135
00:09:18,251 --> 00:09:21,394
Udon ham juda mazali.

136
00:09:21,418 --> 00:09:26,084
Ha, iliq bo‘lgani uchun yoqadi.

137
00:09:26,107 --> 00:09:28,741
Yeyishni boshlaymiz!

138
00:09:28,764 --> 00:09:31,397
Yeyishni boshlaymiz!

139
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:35,391
Karri juda mazali ekan.

140
00:09:35,414 --> 00:09:38,081
Yaxshi bo‘ldi.

141
00:09:38,104 --> 00:09:40,274
Achiq emasmi?

142
00:09:40,297 --> 00:09:43,397
Yaxshi, hech muammo yo‘q.

143
00:09:43,420 --> 00:09:47,321
Men achchiq taomlarni yoqtiraman.

144
00:09:47,345 --> 00:09:50,294
Shundaymi?

145
00:09:50,318 --> 00:09:54,493
Yapon taomlaridan yoqtirmagan narsang bormi?

146
00:09:54,516 --> 00:09:59,016
Hali hech narsa topmadim.

147
00:09:59,039 --> 00:10:01,339
Rostdanmi?

148
00:10:01,362 --> 00:10:04,736
Natyo yeya olasanmi?

149
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:10,893
Natyo deb? Hali tatib ko‘rmaganman.

150
00:10:10,916 --> 00:10:14,018
Keyinroq tatib ko‘r.

151
00:10:14,041 --> 00:10:16,575
Mazali bo‘ladi.

152
00:10:16,598 --> 00:10:20,572
Ha, sinab ko‘raman.

153
00:10:20,595 --> 00:10:25,383
Ovqatlanish zalidagi menyuda eng yoqtirgan taomingiz qaysi?

154
00:10:25,407 --> 00:10:29,242
Karey- guruch va qovurilgan tovuq.

155
00:10:29,266 --> 00:10:32,983
Qovurilgan tovuq ham juda mazali, shunday emasmi?

156
00:10:33,007 --> 00:10:37,273
Ha. Goʻshti juda yumshoq.

157
00:10:37,296 --> 00:10:43,030
A, kelgusi hafta universitetda dam olish kunlari boʻladi-ku.

158
00:10:43,053 --> 00:10:46,619
Rostdanmi?

159
00:10:46,642 --> 00:10:52,609
Ha, payshanba va juma kunlari dam olish kunlari boʻladi.

160
00:10:52,632 --> 00:10:55,709
Toʻrt kunlik taʼtil ekan-ku.

161
00:10:55,732 --> 00:10:59,166
Juda ham xursand boʻldim.

162
00:10:59,189 --> 00:11:04,928
Men issiq ovqatlanayotgan vaqtlarni yaxshi koʻraman.

163
00:11:04,951 --> 00:11:09,851
Doʻstlarim bilan kulib, ovqatlanamiz.

164
00:11:09,874 --> 00:11:15,407
Har bir kunimda koʻp baxtlar bor.

165
00:11:15,430 --> 00:11:16,930
4-SAHNA: YAKSHANBAGI SHAHARDA SAYR / Yakshanba kuni shaharda sayr qilish

166
00:11:16,930 --> 00:11:20,863
Bugun yakshanba.

167
00:11:20,886 --> 00:11:26,820
Men yolgʻiz shaharda sayr qilyapman.

168
00:11:26,843 --> 00:11:32,509
Dam olish kunlarida Yaponiyaning shaharlari juda gavjum boʻladi.

169
00:11:32,532 --> 00:11:36,599
Koʻp katta binolar bor.

170
00:11:36,622 --> 00:11:41,922
Mening mamlakatimdagidan koʻra, binolar balandroq.

171
00:11:41,945 --> 00:11:49,012
Biroz yursangiz, kichikroq bogʻlar ham uchratasiz.

172
00:11:49,035 --> 00:11:52,309
Eski doʻkonlar ham bor.

173
00:11:52,332 --> 00:11:57,091
Bu shaharda sayr qilish juda qiziqarli.

174
00:11:57,115 --> 00:12:00,081
A, ana u.

175
00:12:00,104 --> 00:12:02,338
Nima?

176
00:12:02,361 --> 00:12:07,094
Shunday ekan. Tasodif-ku.

177
00:12:07,117 --> 00:12:10,755
Sakura-san, salom.

178
00:12:10,778 --> 00:12:13,296
Salom.

179
00:12:13,319 --> 00:12:15,898
Yolgʻiz sayr qilayapsizmi?

180
00:12:15,922 --> 00:12:18,355
Ha.

181
00:12:18,378 --> 00:12:22,245
Suratlar olib yurayotgan edim.

182
00:12:22,268 --> 00:12:26,444
Yaxshi suratlar oldingizmi?

183
00:12:26,467 --> 00:12:28,734
Ha.

184
00:12:28,757 --> 00:12:32,324
Temir yoʻl tramvayini suratga oldim.

185
00:12:32,347 --> 00:12:36,453
Bu atrofdagi tramvaylar juda yoqimli, shunday emasmi?

186
00:12:36,476 --> 00:12:38,669
Ha.

187
00:12:38,693 --> 00:12:42,681
Mening mamlakatimda bundaylari yoʻq.

188
00:12:42,704 --> 00:12:46,438
Juda sekin harakat qiladi.

189
00:12:46,461 --> 00:12:48,598
Ha.

190
00:12:48,621 --> 00:12:52,290
Derazadan koʻrinadigan manzara ham juda chiroyli.

191
00:12:52,314 --> 00:12:56,547
Sakura-san, nima qilyapsiz edi?

192
00:12:56,570 --> 00:13:00,603
Men xarid qilyapman.

193
00:13:00,626 --> 00:13:02,726
Kiyimmi?

194
00:13:02,749 --> 00:13:05,016
Ha.

195
00:13:05,039 --> 00:13:08,512
Yangi koʻylak sotib oldim.

196
00:13:08,536 --> 00:13:11,121
Yaxshi ekan.

197
00:13:11,145 --> 00:13:13,851
Qanday rangda?

198
00:13:13,874 --> 00:13:18,508
Bahorgi yorqin rangda.

199
00:13:18,531 --> 00:13:21,631
Albatta, sizga juda mos keladi.

200
00:13:21,654 --> 00:13:26,363
Endi kafega choy ichishga borishni oʻylayapman.

201
00:13:26,386 --> 00:13:28,853
Kafemi?

202
00:13:28,876 --> 00:13:31,749
Birga bormaymizmi?

203
00:13:31,772 --> 00:13:33,942
Ha.

204
00:13:33,965 --> 00:13:36,798
Albatta, borishni istayman.

205
00:13:36,821 --> 00:13:41,768
Yaqin atrofda mazali tortlar sotiladigan doʻkon bor.

206
00:13:41,792 --> 00:13:46,164
Men shirinliklarni juda yaxshi koʻraman.

207
00:13:46,187 --> 00:13:49,621
Unda, oʻsha yerga boramiz.

208
00:13:49,644 --> 00:13:52,824
Biroz uzoqmi?

209
00:13:52,847 --> 00:13:57,246
Bu yerdan piyoda besh daqiqa boradi.

210
00:13:57,270 --> 00:13:59,938
Tushunarli.

211
00:13:59,961 --> 00:14:05,028
Yapon keksalari nafaqat chiroyli, balki juda mazali ham!

212
00:14:05,051 --> 00:14:07,009
Ha.

213
00:14:07,032 --> 00:14:09,535
Kutishdan sabrsizlanaman.

214
00:14:09,558 --> 00:14:14,260
Tasodifan doʻstim bilan uchrashsam, juda xursand boʻlaman.

215
00:14:14,284 --> 00:14:22,617
Yolgʻiz sayr qilish ham yoqadi, lekin kimdir bilan birga sayr qilish yanada ajoyib!

216
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:27,198
Bugun ajoyib dam olish kuniga oʻxshaydi.

217
00:14:27,221 --> 00:14:28,721
5-SAHNA: Birinchi tennis sinovi / Tennisga birinchi qadam

218
00:14:28,721 --> 00:14:34,467
Men universitetning tennis toʻgaragiga qoʻshildim.

219
00:14:34,491 --> 00:14:39,524
Mening vatanimda koʻpincha futbol oʻynardim.

220
00:14:39,547 --> 00:14:42,781
Tennis uchun bu mening ilk tajribam.

221
00:14:42,804 --> 00:14:47,989
Ammo yangi sport turini sinab koʻrmoqchi edim.

222
00:14:48,012 --> 00:14:52,545
Kortda yugurish juda yoqimli his qiladi.

223
00:14:52,568 --> 00:14:56,635
Toʻpga zarba berish ovozi ham yoqadi.

224
00:14:56,658 --> 00:15:01,043
Yaxshiroq boʻlish uchun koʻp mashq qilaman.

225
00:15:01,067 --> 00:15:03,972
Charchadingizmi?

226
00:15:03,996 --> 00:15:07,177
Mashgʻulotdan charchadingizmi?

227
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:10,700
Bugungi mashgʻulot qanday boʻldi?

228
00:15:10,723 --> 00:15:14,037
Juda charchadim.

229
00:15:14,061 --> 00:15:17,166
Lekin juda qiziqarli edi.

230
00:15:17,190 --> 00:15:20,726
Juda yaxshi oʻsdingiz-ku!

231
00:15:20,749 --> 00:15:23,383
Rostdanmi?

232
00:15:23,406 --> 00:15:26,139
Xursandchilik!

233
00:15:26,162 --> 00:15:28,395
Ha.

234
00:15:28,418 --> 00:15:32,593
Dastlab toʻpga tegmasdim-ku.

235
00:15:32,617 --> 00:15:35,013
Ha.

236
00:15:35,036 --> 00:15:39,178
Chunki Sakura-san menga juda mehribonlik bilan oʻrgatdi.

237
00:15:39,202 --> 00:15:43,335
Har kuni mashq qilayotganingiz uchun.

238
00:15:43,358 --> 00:15:47,728
Tennis juda qiziqarli sport ekan, shunday emasmi?

239
00:15:47,752 --> 00:15:50,586
Ha, rostdan ham.

240
00:15:50,609 --> 00:15:53,447
Musobaqaga chiqmoqchimisiz?

241
00:15:53,470 --> 00:15:55,636
Ha.

242
00:15:55,659 --> 00:15:59,759
Qachondir musobaqaga chiqmoqchiman.

243
00:15:59,782 --> 00:16:04,416
Kelgusi oy toʻgarakning kichik musobaqasi boʻladi.

244
00:16:04,439 --> 00:16:07,172
Rostdanmi?

245
00:16:07,195 --> 00:16:10,666
Men ham chiqsam boʻladi-mi?

246
00:16:10,690 --> 00:16:13,487
Albatta, chiqishingiz mumkin.

247
00:16:13,510 --> 00:16:16,288
Birga chiqamizmi?

248
00:16:16,312 --> 00:16:18,612
Ha?

249
00:16:18,635 --> 00:16:21,623
Sakura-san bilan juftlikda-mi?

250
00:16:21,647 --> 00:16:24,001
Ha.

251
00:16:24,024 --> 00:16:28,491
Men oldinda, siz orqada.

252
00:16:28,514 --> 00:16:30,086
Qanday?

253
00:16:30,109 --> 00:16:34,306
Ehtimol, men sizning oyoqlaringizni tortib qoʻyaman.

254
00:16:34,330 --> 00:16:37,266
Hech qisi yoq, muammo emas.

255
00:16:37,289 --> 00:16:40,390
Eng muhimi – zavqlanish.

256
00:16:40,413 --> 00:16:43,280
Tushunarli.

257
00:16:43,303 --> 00:16:46,012
Iltimos, yordam bering.

258
00:16:46,035 --> 00:16:51,069
Keyingi haftadan boshlab koʻproq mashq qilamiz, rozi-misiz?

259
00:16:51,092 --> 00:16:53,158
Ha.

260
00:16:53,181 --> 00:16:55,548
Albatta, harakat qilaman!

261
00:16:55,571 --> 00:16:59,806
Koʻproq yugurish mashqi kerak boʻladi, balki?

262
00:16:59,829 --> 00:17:02,306
Ha, shundaydek.

263
00:17:02,330 --> 00:17:05,469
Chidamlilikni oshiraman.

264
00:17:05,493 --> 00:17:09,660
Mashqdan keyin sharbat ichish juda mazali, shunday emasmi?

265
00:17:09,683 --> 00:17:12,149
Ha.

266
00:17:12,172 --> 00:17:15,239
Sovuq va juda mazali!

267
00:17:15,262 --> 00:17:19,739
Men juda koʻp terladim.

268
00:17:19,762 --> 00:17:24,077
Shamollamangizga e’tibor bering.

269
00:17:24,101 --> 00:17:26,067
Ha.

270
00:17:26,090 --> 00:17:28,524
Rahmat.

271
00:17:28,547 --> 00:17:33,647
Men doiradoshlarimni juda yaxshi ko’raman.

272
00:17:33,670 --> 00:17:37,570
Barchamiz birga ter to’kamiz.

273
00:17:37,593 --> 00:17:43,093
Yaponiyadagi talabalik hayotimning eng yaxshi xotirasiga aylanadi.

274
00:17:43,116 --> 00:17:44,616
6-SAHNA: Yaponiyada mijozlarga xizmat qilish / Yaponiyada yarim kunlik ish

275
00:17:44,616 --> 00:17:51,362
Men vokzal yaqinidagi kafeda yarim kunlik ish boshladim.

276
00:17:51,385 --> 00:17:57,505
O’z vatanimda hech qachon yarim kunlik ish qilmagan edim.

277
00:17:57,529 --> 00:18:02,408
Yaponiyada mijozlarga xizmat qilish juda odobli.

278
00:18:02,431 --> 00:18:08,664
Dastlab «Xush kelibsiz!» deganimni aytishdan uyalardim.

279
00:18:08,687 --> 00:18:13,441
Endi esa baland ovozda aytolaman.

280
00:18:13,465 --> 00:18:18,244
Mijozlarning tabassumini ko’rish juda yoqimli.

281
00:18:18,268 --> 00:18:22,334
Charchadingmi? Smena tugadi mi?

282
00:18:22,357 --> 00:18:26,595
Ha, hozir tugadi.

283
00:18:26,619 --> 00:18:30,408
Bugun juda band edingiz-ku.

284
00:18:30,431 --> 00:18:35,229
Ha, ko’p mijozlar keldi.

285
00:18:35,253 --> 00:18:38,386
Buyurtmada xato bo’lmadi-ku?

286
00:18:38,409 --> 00:18:42,709
Ha, birorta ham xato yo’q edi.

287
00:18:42,732 --> 00:18:47,723
Ajoyib! Endi butunlay ko’nikib qolding.

288
00:18:47,747 --> 00:18:50,980
Bu Sakura-senpai tufayli.

289
00:18:51,003 --> 00:18:54,720
Bu yerda senpai demang.

290
00:18:54,744 --> 00:18:59,044
Yo’q, ish paytida senpai siz.

291
00:18:59,067 --> 00:19:01,700
Jiddiy ekan.

292
00:19:01,723 --> 00:19:05,228
Yapon tilingiz ham yaxshi bo’ldi.

293
00:19:05,251 --> 00:19:09,998
Menuda menyudagi barcha so’zlarni yod oldim.

294
00:19:10,022 --> 00:19:12,455
Ajoyib!

295
00:19:12,478 --> 00:19:15,978
Mijozlar bilan ham gaplasha olasizmi?

296
00:19:16,001 --> 00:19:21,468
Ha, biroz ob-havo haqida gapiramiz.

297
00:19:21,491 --> 00:19:25,924
Yaxshi. Mijozlar ham xursand bo’ladilar.

298
00:19:25,947 --> 00:19:30,286
Kofe tayyorlashni ham yaxshi o’rganmoqchiman.

299
00:19:30,310 --> 00:19:33,810
Bir kun kelib o’rgatib qo’yaman.

300
00:19:33,833 --> 00:19:36,104
Rostdanmi?

301
00:19:36,128 --> 00:19:38,901
Iltimos, yordam bering.

302
00:19:38,924 --> 00:19:42,296
Yaponiyadagi yarim kunlik ish qanday?

303
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:47,221
Ko’p narsalarni o’rganish kerak, lekin qiziqarli.

304
00:19:47,244 --> 00:19:51,399
Shundaymi? Unda yaxshi.

305
00:19:51,422 --> 00:19:55,889
O’z pulimni olganda juda xursand bo’laman.

306
00:19:55,912 --> 00:19:59,179
Yarim kunlik ish puli bilan nima xarid qilmoqchisiz?

307
00:19:59,202 --> 00:20:03,548
Yangi kameraning linzasini xarid qilmoqchiman.

308
00:20:03,571 --> 00:20:06,968
Ertaga ham yarim kunlik ish bormi?

309
00:20:06,991 --> 00:20:11,100
Yo’q, ertaga dam olish kunim.

310
00:20:11,124 --> 00:20:14,243
Yaxshi dam oling.

311
00:20:14,266 --> 00:20:16,862
Ha, rahmat.

312
00:20:16,886 --> 00:20:20,635
E’tiborli bo’lib boring.

313
00:20:20,659 --> 00:20:26,492
Ishdan keyin kechki shamol juda yoqimli.

314
00:20:26,515 --> 00:20:30,882
O’zim ishlab pul topaman.

315
00:20:30,905 --> 00:20:35,055
Ozroq kattalashgandek his qilaman.

316
00:20:35,078 --> 00:20:36,578
7-SAHNA: Chet ellik talabalar nutqining tayyorlanishi / Chet ellik talabalar nutqi uchun tayyorgarlik

317
00:20:36,578 --> 00:20:42,489
Kelgusi shanba kuni chet ellik talabalar nutq tanlovi bo’ladi.

318
00:20:42,513 --> 00:20:47,146
Meni vakil qilib tanladilar.

319
00:20:47,169 --> 00:20:50,403
Juda asabim qo’zg’almoqda.

320
00:20:50,426 --> 00:20:55,170
Mavzu – mening vatanim va Yaponiya.

321
00:20:55,193 --> 00:20:58,827
Aytmoqchi boʻlgan koʻp narsalarim bor.

322
00:20:58,850 --> 00:21:04,724
Ammo yapon tilida uzoq gapirish qiyin.

323
00:21:04,747 --> 00:21:09,814
Har kecha xonamdagi oynaning oldida mashq qilaman.

324
00:21:09,837 --> 00:21:13,614
Nutq matni tayyor boʻldimi?

325
00:21:13,638 --> 00:21:17,704
Ha, qisman yozib qoʻydim.

326
00:21:17,727 --> 00:21:20,261
Koʻrsatib ber.

327
00:21:20,284 --> 00:21:23,517
Men tekshirib qoʻyaman.

328
00:21:23,540 --> 00:21:26,173
Iltimos.

329
00:21:26,196 --> 00:21:31,371
Yaxshi ekan. Mazmuni juda zoʻr.

330
00:21:31,395 --> 00:21:33,562
Rostdanmi?

331
00:21:33,585 --> 00:21:37,357
Gʻalati yaponcha soʻzlar yoʻqmi?

332
00:21:37,380 --> 00:21:42,254
Bu yerda soʻzlar bir oz gʻalatiroqdek.

333
00:21:42,277 --> 00:21:45,577
Qanday tuzatish kerak?

334
00:21:45,600 --> 00:21:50,135
Bu soʻzlar tabiiyroq boʻladi.

335
00:21:50,158 --> 00:21:53,757
Tushunarli, raxmat.

336
00:21:53,780 --> 00:21:59,016
Yapon madaniyatidan juda hayratda qolding-ku.

337
00:21:59,040 --> 00:22:04,307
Ha, chunki mening yurtimda bunday madaniyat yoʻq.

338
00:22:04,330 --> 00:22:08,271
Ayniqsa nimadan hayratda qolding?

339
00:22:08,294 --> 00:22:12,250
Barchasining qoidalarni rioya qilishidan.

340
00:22:12,273 --> 00:22:16,407
A, masalan, poyezdda navbat turish.

341
00:22:16,430 --> 00:22:21,263
Ha, juda tartibli navbat turishadi.

342
00:22:21,286 --> 00:22:25,953
Bu hamma albatta hayratda qoladi.

343
00:22:25,976 --> 00:22:28,809
Ishonchim ortdi.

344
00:22:28,832 --> 00:22:31,265
Rahmat.

345
00:22:31,288 --> 00:22:36,226
Endi faqat baland ovozda gapirish kerak.

346
00:22:36,250 --> 00:22:41,117
Ha, talaffuzni ham mashq qilmoqchiman.

347
00:22:41,139 --> 00:22:45,373
Endi bir oz mashq qilamizmi?

348
00:22:45,396 --> 00:22:48,096
Hozirmi?

349
00:22:48,119 --> 00:22:51,152
Uyalaman.

350
00:22:51,175 --> 00:22:55,119
Hech kim yoʻq, muammo yoʻq.

351
00:22:55,143 --> 00:22:57,247
Tushunarli.

352
00:22:57,271 --> 00:22:59,771
Oʻqiyman.

353
00:22:59,794 --> 00:23:03,367
Yaxshi, sekin oʻqi.

354
00:23:03,390 --> 00:23:06,857
Hammaga salom.

355
00:23:06,880 --> 00:23:10,470
Men...

356
00:23:10,493 --> 00:23:14,200
Ha, shu ovoz balandligi bilan yaxshi.

357
00:23:14,224 --> 00:23:17,524
Shu tarzda davom etaman.

358
00:23:17,547 --> 00:23:20,780
Aslida ham sizni koʻrgan holda boraman.

359
00:23:20,803 --> 00:23:26,348
Doʻstlarim tinglashini bilganimda kuch toʻplayman.

360
00:23:26,371 --> 00:23:32,210
Oʻz soʻzlarim bilan oʻz his-tuygʻularimni yetkazaman.

361
00:23:32,233 --> 00:23:35,333
Qattiq harakat qilaman.

362
00:23:35,356 --> 00:23:36,856
Sahna 8: Yakuniy imtihonlarga tayyorgarlik

363
00:23:36,856 --> 00:23:41,627
Keyingi hafta yakuniy imtihonlar.

364
00:23:41,651 --> 00:23:46,884
Yapon universitetlarining imtihonlari qiyin.

365
00:23:46,907 --> 00:23:52,607
Men har kuni kutubxonada oʻqiyman.

366
00:23:52,630 --> 00:23:58,497
Derazadan tashqaridagi manzara butkul qishga aylandi.

367
00:23:58,520 --> 00:24:03,156
Mening yurtimda qish boʻlmaydi.

368
00:24:03,180 --> 00:24:08,880
Shuning uchun sovuq shamolni biroz sevmayman.

369
00:24:08,903 --> 00:24:14,736
Ammo qishki yulduzli osmon juda chiroyli deb oʻylayman.

370
00:24:14,759 --> 00:24:18,115
Oʻqishlaring qanday?

371
00:24:18,138 --> 00:24:21,471
A, Sakura-san.

372
00:24:21,494 --> 00:24:25,561
Yoʻq, umuman yomon.

373
00:24:25,584 --> 00:24:29,117
Nimani oʻqiysan?

374
00:24:29,140 --> 00:24:32,681
Iqtisodiyot testiga tayyorlanmoqdaman.

375
00:24:32,704 --> 00:24:35,684
Iqtisodiyotmi?

376
00:24:35,708 --> 00:24:39,741
Mutaxassislik atamalari qiyin, shunday emasmi?

377
00:24:39,764 --> 00:24:43,834
Ha. Kanjilarni o‘qiy olmayapman.

378
00:24:43,858 --> 00:24:47,098
Qayeri tushunmayapsan?

379
00:24:47,121 --> 00:24:49,754
Men tushuntirib beraman.

380
00:24:49,777 --> 00:24:53,744
Bu yerda grafikning ma’nosi nima, tushunmayapman.

381
00:24:53,767 --> 00:24:59,045
A, mana bu. Raqamlar ko‘tarilib bormoqda, ko‘ryapsanmi?

382
00:24:59,068 --> 00:25:03,181
Ha. Doimiy ravishda ko‘tarilmoqda.

383
00:25:03,205 --> 00:25:08,471
Demak, narx oshib borayapti degani.

384
00:25:08,494 --> 00:25:12,794
Aha, shunday ekan.

385
00:25:12,817 --> 00:25:16,117
Shunday, oddiy emasmi?

386
00:25:16,140 --> 00:25:20,573
Sakura-san o‘rgatganda, darrov tushuniladi.

387
00:25:20,596 --> 00:25:25,375
Yaxshi. Yana tushunmaydigan joylar bormi?

388
00:25:25,399 --> 00:25:28,699
Hozircha hammasi joyida.

389
00:25:28,722 --> 00:25:31,789
Tun bo‘yi o‘qiyapsanmi?

390
00:25:31,812 --> 00:25:37,112
Ha. Kecha soat 3gacha o‘qidim.

391
00:25:37,135 --> 00:25:40,640
Juda zo‘r bo‘lma.

392
00:25:40,663 --> 00:25:43,163
Yaxshi, hech muammo yo‘q.

393
00:25:43,186 --> 00:25:45,985
Yoshman, muammo yo‘q.

394
00:25:46,008 --> 00:25:49,761
Salomatliging buzilsa, katta muammo bo‘ladi.

395
00:25:49,785 --> 00:25:52,940
Ha. E’tibor beraman.

396
00:25:52,963 --> 00:25:56,796
Endi biroz dam olamizmi?

397
00:25:56,819 --> 00:26:00,753
Ha, kofe olish uchun chiqaylik.

398
00:26:00,776 --> 00:26:04,746
Men shirin kakao ichishni xohlayman.

399
00:26:04,769 --> 00:26:08,269
Men olib kelaman.

400
00:26:08,292 --> 00:26:10,859
Rostdanmi?

401
00:26:10,882 --> 00:26:12,748
Rahmat.

402
00:26:12,771 --> 00:26:17,538
Har doim o‘rgatib turasiz, bu kichik xizmat arzimaydi.

403
00:26:17,561 --> 00:26:21,028
Unday bo‘lsa, so‘zingizga rozi bo‘laman.

404
00:26:21,051 --> 00:26:24,284
Biroz kutib turing.

405
00:26:24,307 --> 00:26:28,045
Yaponiyaning qishi sovuq.

406
00:26:28,068 --> 00:26:33,801
Lekin do‘stlarning mehribonligi yuragimni isitadi.

407
00:26:33,824 --> 00:26:38,537
Test tugagach, hammamiz birga sayrga chiqmoqchimiz.

408
00:26:38,561 --> 00:26:40,061
9-sahna: Madaniy festivalda okonomiyaki do‘koni / Universitet festivalida okonomiyaki do‘koni

409
00:26:40,061 --> 00:26:45,961
Bu hafta oxiri universitetda madaniy festival bo‘ladi.

410
00:26:45,984 --> 00:26:51,503
Bizning sinf okonomiyaki do‘konini ochadi.

411
00:26:51,527 --> 00:26:56,960
Okonomiyaki – yaponcha pitsa kabi.

412
00:26:56,983 --> 00:27:02,460
Men bu taomni juda yaxshi ko‘raman.

413
00:27:02,484 --> 00:27:06,671
Hammamiz sinfni bezaymiz.

414
00:27:06,694 --> 00:27:11,760
Kartonlarni kesamiz, rasmlar chizamiz.

415
00:27:11,783 --> 00:27:17,059
Bunday festivallar mening yurtimda bo‘lmasdi.

416
00:27:17,083 --> 00:27:21,652
Ega, bu ranglar yaxshi bo‘ldimi?

417
00:27:21,675 --> 00:27:24,775
Juda chiroyli.

418
00:27:24,798 --> 00:27:27,698
Ko‘zni oladi.

419
00:27:27,721 --> 00:27:29,621
Rahmat.

420
00:27:29,645 --> 00:27:33,355
Rasm chizishda ham zo‘rsan-ku.

421
00:27:33,378 --> 00:27:37,812
Kichkinaligimdan beri rasm chizishni yaxshi ko‘raman.

422
00:27:37,835 --> 00:27:42,701
Bu personaj juda yoqimli ekan.

423
00:27:42,724 --> 00:27:45,480
Rostdanmi?

424
00:27:45,504 --> 00:27:48,378
Xursandchilik!

425
00:27:48,402 --> 00:27:52,239
Okonomiyaki pishirishni mashq qildingmi?

426
00:27:52,263 --> 00:27:54,496
Ha.

427
00:27:54,519 --> 00:27:58,474
Kecha uyda mashq qildim.

428
00:27:58,498 --> 00:28:01,831
Yaxshi ag‘darib bera oldingmi?

429
00:28:01,854 --> 00:28:05,554
Birinchi urinishda muvaffaqiyatsizlikka uchradim.

430
00:28:05,577 --> 00:28:08,644
Qiyin, shunday emasmi?

431
00:28:08,667 --> 00:28:12,810
Lekin ikkinchi marta mukammal boʻldi.

432
00:28:12,833 --> 00:28:15,405
Ajoyib!

433
00:28:15,428 --> 00:28:18,062
Aslida ham sizga ishonaman.

434
00:28:18,085 --> 00:28:20,189
Ha.

435
00:28:20,212 --> 00:28:23,045
Koʻp pishiramiz.

436
00:28:23,068 --> 00:28:26,974
Karamni toʻgʻrashga ham yordam berasanmi?

437
00:28:26,997 --> 00:28:29,112
Ha.

438
00:28:29,136 --> 00:28:31,836
Ishoning, qilaman.

439
00:28:31,859 --> 00:28:37,046
Sous hidlanganda, qorni och boʻladi, shundaymi?

440
00:28:37,070 --> 00:28:39,020
Ha.

441
00:28:39,044 --> 00:28:41,910
Tezroq yeyishni xohlayapman.

442
00:28:41,933 --> 00:28:45,567
Ertaga band boʻladi, shundaymi?

443
00:28:45,590 --> 00:28:50,323
Koʻp mehmonlar kelishini tilaymiz.

444
00:28:50,346 --> 00:28:53,820
Albatta koʻp keladilar.

445
00:28:53,844 --> 00:28:56,877
Barchasi sotilib ketganida nima qilamiz?

446
00:28:56,900 --> 00:29:01,133
Oʻsha paytda hammamiz xursand boʻlamiz.

447
00:29:01,156 --> 00:29:04,056
Katta muvaffaqiyatga erishamiz.

448
00:29:04,079 --> 00:29:08,858
Tayyorgarlik tugagach, hammamiz birga ovqatlanishga boring.

449
00:29:08,881 --> 00:29:11,415
Yaxshi ekan.

450
00:29:11,438 --> 00:29:13,938
Boramiz!

451
00:29:13,961 --> 00:29:18,894
Madaniy festivalga tayyorgarlik juda qiziqarli.

452
00:29:18,917 --> 00:29:24,428
Sinfdoshlarimiz bitta maqsadga intilib harakat qilmoqdalar.

453
00:29:24,451 --> 00:29:29,157
Menga bu birdamlik juda yoqadi.

454
00:29:29,181 --> 00:29:30,681
10-sahna: Madaniy festival xotiralari

455
00:29:30,681 --> 00:29:34,114
Madaniy festival yakunlandi.

456
00:29:34,137 --> 00:29:38,970
Bizning doʻkonimiz katta muvaffaqiyatga erishdi.

457
00:29:38,994 --> 00:29:43,584
Okonomiyaki hammasi sotilib ketdi.

458
00:29:43,608 --> 00:29:49,574
Tozalash tugagandan keyin universitet juda tinch.

459
00:29:49,597 --> 00:29:55,131
Bayramdan keyin biroz yolgʻizlik hissi boʻladi.

460
00:29:55,154 --> 00:30:01,705
Lekin zavqli xotiralar doimo qalbimizda qoladi.

461
00:30:01,728 --> 00:30:04,261
Charchadingizmi?

462
00:30:04,284 --> 00:30:09,384
A, Sakura-san. Charchadingizmi?

463
00:30:09,407 --> 00:30:12,960
Ajoyib madaniy festival boʻldi, shundaymi?

464
00:30:12,984 --> 00:30:17,084
Ha, ajoyib kun boʻldi.

465
00:30:17,107 --> 00:30:21,015
Doimo pishirib turganingiz uchun raxmat.

466
00:30:21,039 --> 00:30:25,772
Yoʻq, men juda zavqlandim.

467
00:30:25,795 --> 00:30:30,228
Mehmonlar, juda mazali ekanligini aytishdi.

468
00:30:30,251 --> 00:30:34,918
Buni eshitib, juda xursand boʻldim.

469
00:30:34,941 --> 00:30:38,925
Sinfdoshlar ham xursand boʻlishdi.

470
00:30:38,948 --> 00:30:41,943
Hammasi juda yaxshi boʻldi.

471
00:30:41,967 --> 00:30:45,067
Biroz charchadik, shundaymi?

472
00:30:45,090 --> 00:30:49,356
Ha, oyoqlarim ogʻriyapti.

473
00:30:49,379 --> 00:30:52,279
Yaxshi dam oling.

474
00:30:52,302 --> 00:30:56,436
Sakura-san ham yaxshi dam oling.

475
00:30:56,459 --> 00:30:59,592
Endi nima qilmoqchisiz?

476
00:30:59,615 --> 00:31:03,082
Doʻstlar bilan ziyofatga boraman.

477
00:31:03,104 --> 00:31:06,838
Men ham boraman.

478
00:31:06,861 --> 00:31:09,407
Bir xil joyda boʻladimi?

479
00:31:09,430 --> 00:31:12,730
Stansiya oldidagi izakaya (yaponcha bar).

480
00:31:12,753 --> 00:31:16,087
A, bir xil joyda.

481
00:31:16,110 --> 00:31:19,585
Unda birga boring.

482
00:31:19,608 --> 00:31:23,541
Ha, piyoda boramiz.

483
00:31:23,564 --> 00:31:27,156
Bugun koʻp ovqatlanamiz, shundaymi?

484
00:31:27,180 --> 00:31:31,313
Ha, koʻp ichamiz.

485
00:31:31,336 --> 00:31:35,203
Men uchun juda zavqli boʻldi.

486
00:31:35,226 --> 00:31:37,897
Men ham.

487
00:31:37,920 --> 00:31:41,153
Unutilmas xotiralar.

488
00:31:41,176 --> 00:31:44,758
Ertaga maktabda koʻrishamiz.

489
00:31:44,782 --> 00:31:48,449
Ha, ertaga koʻrishamiz.

490
00:31:48,472 --> 00:31:53,306
Tungi osmonda chiroyli oy porlayapti.

491
00:31:53,330 --> 00:31:57,996
Mening vatanimdan koʻrgan oy bilan bir xil.

492
00:31:58,019 --> 00:32:04,553
Men bu yurtda beqiyos daqiqalarni oʻtkazyapman.

493
00:32:04,576 --> 00:32:10,117
Ertaga ham albatta ajoyib kun boʻladi.